# mc then 4 picks blue; Cycle Color, keyless, twice from Go to Command on an uncolored task gives yellow.
file <<END
Sprint:
	- Design
	- Build
END
keys j mc
see Color:
keys 4
hide Color:
keys j <C-p>
type cycle color
keys <Enter> <C-p>
type cycle color
keys <Enter>
quit
saved <<END
Sprint:
	- Design @blue
	- Build @yellow
END
